  <item>
    <title>vol.34 一战再战，老革命遇到新问题</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6929d598ba2292550f456715</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6929d598ba2292550f456715</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 28 Nov 2025 18:23:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>尽管剪辑拖延了整整一周，但令人惊喜的是《一战再战》依然没有下档，太好了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">00:01:44</a> 每个人的评分体系各有不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">00:06:00</a> 形象崩塌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">00:11:25</a> 假如边境墙真的存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">00:14:38</a> 那么，导演在讽刺谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">00:15:22</a> 在座的各位都是乐色！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">00:16:12</a> 滑右翼之大稽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">00:29:53</a> 怒左翼之不争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2119">00:35:19</a> 谁还没年轻过呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">00:39:49</a> 可爱又迷人的反派角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2673">00:44:33</a> 西格玛男人是何意味？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2723">00:45:23</a> 塞尔吉奥大师传承自切·格瓦拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2897">00:48:17</a> 背叛、爱的错位和自我认同的落差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">00:53:57</a> 反面教材：编号17</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3509">00:58:29</a> 配拿奥斯卡吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">00:59:00</a> 堪称经典的山路追逐戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3954">01:05:54</a> 杀死鲍勃</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65ea8a00803b6eac13983130/lpxDCQ5NYvH5xjIsjtiiPxh32jrZ.m4a" length="99634373" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvIiWy1By-mvIZVOL9rjmo1r8OVB.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.33 暑期逛展，浦美奥赛，不光是看个热闹</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d4112b522b40626c1def74</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d4112b522b40626c1def74</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Sep 2025 15:44:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>浦东美术馆“缔造现代：来自巴黎奥赛博物馆的艺术瑰宝“展览将持续到今年10/12。</span></p><span></span><p><span>更新一下夜巡的近况：进了防弹玻璃小房间，公开修复中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后希望朋友们能更多地去到线下的博物馆和艺术展览，但要记得错峰哦。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">00:01:45</a> 跟着专业老师开团看展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="387">00:06:27</a> 维纳斯的诞生不止一幅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">00:09:09</a> 缔造现代，何为现代？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">00:15:53</a> 艺术的演进不是突变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">00:19:42</a> 颜料的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1412">00:23:32</a> 卅萌top1是马奈的《左拉》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">00:25:26</a> 关于巴黎奥赛博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">00:29:34</a> 印象派名称的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">00:30:44</a> 子龙top1是《1814年法国战役》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">00:33:51</a> 财富自由的莫奈是如何工作的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2144">00:35:44</a> 阿尔勒星空下的咖啡馆倒闭了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2241">00:37:21</a> 坐拥40万法郎遗产够不够支撑一辈子画画？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">00:42:36</a> 卅萌对印象派抱有一点偏见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2939">00:48:59</a> 被嫌弃的梵高的一生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3221">00:53:41</a> 三段无疾而终的恋情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">00:57:53</a> 不如用心做文创</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3586">00:59:46</a> 高更肖像和它重见天日的背面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3683">01:01:23</a> 归隐塔希提画画的金融男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3925">01:05:25</a> 纳比派的猫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4068">01:07:48</a> 楼上还有陈逸飞，威尼斯也是水乡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4292">01:11:32</a> 浦美首展，泰特美术馆大展“光”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65ea8a00803b6eac13983130/lkszlvghc1IHuButBnzDcGtPhj7E.m4a" length="122472411" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:24:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnB51SRkJyc_JxNORyv3-UkWbeFf.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.32 今夕是何年？冲绳谈判和美日纺织品协议</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687e3288a12f9ff06a49cc77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687e3288a12f9ff06a49cc77</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是基于两位主播所读的两本书：野口悠纪雄的《日本战后经济史》和亨利·基辛格的回忆录《白宫岁月》，来陪伴大家一起回顾一下尼克松政府的头两年在美日之间发生的两三件往事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>多年以后，面对特朗普，有多少人会回想起，尼克松初掌国政的那个遥远的一九六九？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">00:01:27</a> 白宫椭圆形办公室为何惊现世俱杯新科冠军奖杯？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">00:03:32</a> EC-121预警机遭击落事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">00:05:33</a> 《美日安保条约》与安保斗争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">00:08:53</a> 三岛由纪夫：比起政变，当然还是交稿优先</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">00:14:02</a> 冲绳谈判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">00:21:09</a> 现任美国总统国家安全事务助理是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">00:29:23</a> 如何获得诺贝尔和平奖？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1937">00:32:17</a> 布雷顿森林体系和第一次尼克松冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">00:37:17</a> 纺织品协议：以绳换丝，一场惨败？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">00:44:40</a> 友好未必是真的，但不妨碍歌是好听的</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期配乐：《島人ぬ宝》、《恋》</span></p><span></span><p><span>演出：アメリカ空軍太平洋音楽隊</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65ea8a00803b6eac13983130/llF1YlU6jAhJh9tRKiCl03P46THd.m4a" length="71032639" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjl-y9oR6hynfXznVdmwpnS9C98W.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol. 31 我们热爱的足球似乎被资本玩坏了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683eefd038dcc57c645c4ec4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683eefd038dcc57c645c4ec4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在本期节目发布前我们获悉，常州中华恐龙园废除之前对扬州游客的门票免费优惠，并对他们紧急加征124%的关税。特此通知。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:00:44</a> 巴黎勇夺欧冠，赛季尘埃落定，终是几家欢喜几家愁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">00:04:48</a> 曼彻斯特联——最早开始备战下赛季的球队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">00:06:23</a> 不如去看江苏城市足球联赛？真正的热血足球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">00:15:38</a> 资本对曼联都做了什么？格雷泽家族的杠杆收购</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">00:29:39</a> 在纽交所重新上市，股价很安详</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">00:41:06</a> 投行高管能经营好老牌足球俱乐部吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">00:48:15</a> 下一位抵达战场的是，拉特克里夫爵士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3217">00:53:37</a> 上市公司搞不好足球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3409">00:56:49</a> 资本对米兰都做了什么？李哥的杠杆收购</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3556">00:59:16</a> 借来的钱还不上了怎么办？接盘侠艾里奥特</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3707">01:01:47</a> 红鸟资本与魔球理论，Make Milan Great Again！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4368">01:12:48</a> 资本对切尔西都做了什么？清湖资本与伯利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4584">01:16:24</a> 皇家贝蒂斯的胸前广告是格力</span></p>]]></description>
