  <item>
    <title>Vol.30 日本行，大阪&amp;京都，意想不到的战国粉丝体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68332a15dce640bfddbfbf45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68332a15dce640bfddbfbf45</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>子龙近期去了一次日本关西，本来是说走就走的旅行去去班味，没想到作为日本战国粉丝的子龙却收获了很多以外惊喜。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">00:03:11</a> 大阪城公园以及天守阁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">00:04:42</a> 夏之阵与冬之阵：大阪城是谁的大阪城？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">00:07:18</a> 角色扮演是付费项目：子龙偏爱真田幸村，德川家康人气低迷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">00:10:32</a> 天守阁里的展品，织田信长的墨迹&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">00:13:16</a> 丰富的纪念品丰俭由人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">00:17:54</a> 真的上头！日本100名城集章册</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">00:22:03</a> 日本店家似乎不怎么在乎米其林？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">00:28:50</a> 隔壁坐着社牛妹子英语怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">00:30:31</a> 碳水！碳水！还是***碳水！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2277">00:37:57</a> 施主，住在京都的寺庙里是种什么体验?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2542">00:42:22</a> 丰城秀吉的结婚纪念日，得是多少周年？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2608">00:43:28</a> 二条城以及京都的城市布局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">00:47:30</a> 将军的地板会报警，将军的御座比人高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3203">00:53:23</a> 二年坂（二寧坂）和三年坂（三寂坂）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3203">00:53:23</a> 完全忘了还有大阪世博会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3893">01:04:53</a> 娄山关路以西就是关西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4042">01:07:22</a> Osaka good， Tokyo bad！</span></p>]]></description>
